  Outside this computer
  • Starts a Cloudflare quick tunnel that forwards only Bonsai's change
    receiver (127.0.0.1:7002) to the internet.
  • Adds a GitHub webhook to octo/bonsai. Their admins see a webhook to a
    trycloudflare.com address marked ?bonsai=<this computer's id>.

  Bonsai saves your settings to ~/.config/bonsai/web.json and starts in the
  background.
  Your browser opens when it is ready.
  Then Bonsai waits for GitHub to confirm each webhook (about a minute at
  most).




